 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "seg3-00",
   "text": "先看充值这一头。",
   "spoken": "先看充值这一头。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep23/audio/lines/seg3-00.mp3",
   "start": 1.6,
   "dur": 2.352,
   "speechStart": 1.698,
   "speechEnd": 3.126
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-01",
   "text": "假充值，是交易所把一笔不该算数的转账，记成了用户的充值。",
   "spoken": "假充值，是交易所把一笔不该算数的转账，记成了用户的充值。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep23/audio/lines/seg3-01.mp3",
   "start": 4.172,
   "dur": 5.832,
   "speechStart": 4.27,
   "speechEnd": 9.162
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-02",
   "text": "失败的、伪造的、到账金额不对的，都算。",
   "spoken": "失败的、伪造的、到账金额不对的，都算。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep23/audio/lines/seg3-02.mp3",
   "start": 10.224,
   "dur": 4.608,
   "speechStart": 10.322,
   "speechEnd": 14.012
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-03",
   "text": "第一种，交易失败了，却已经上链。",
   "spoken": "第一种，交易失败了，却已经上链。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep23/audio/lines/seg3-03.mp3",
   "start": 15.052,
   "dur": 3.576,
   "speechStart": 15.15,
   "speechEnd": 17.792
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-04",
   "text": "扫描服务只看交易存不存在，不看执行状态。",
   "spoken": "扫描服务只看交易存不存在，不看执行状态。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep23/audio/lines/seg3-04.mp3",
   "start": 18.848,
   "dur": 4.752,
   "speechStart": 18.946,
   "speechEnd": 22.755
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-05",
   "text": "2019 年 3 月，SlowMist 披露了 EOS 上的这类手法，TRON 和以太坊也要防。",
   "spoken": "2019 年 3 月，SlowMist 批路了 EOS 上的这类手法，TRON 和以太坊也要防。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep23/audio/lines/seg3-05.mp3",
   "start": 23.82,
   "dur": 6.624,
   "speechStart": 23.918,
   "speechEnd": 29.62
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-06",
   "text": "第二种，无效交易被入账。",
   "spoken": "第二种，无效交易被入账。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep23/audio/lines/seg3-06.mp3",
   "start": 30.664,
   "dur": 3.0,
   "speechStart": 30.762,
   "speechEnd": 32.845
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-07",
   "text": "2018 年 6 月，SlowMist 预警，部分交易所没有校验 Omni-USDT 交易的 valid 字段。",
   "spoken": "2018 年 6 月，SlowMist 预警，部分交易所没有较验 Omni-USDT 交易的 valid 字段。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep23/audio/lines/seg3-07.mp3",
   "start": 33.884,
   "dur": 7.104,
   "speechStart": 33.982,
   "speechEnd": 40.148
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-08",
   "text": "第三种，部分支付，这是 XRP 的一个特性。",
   "spoken": "第三种，部分支付，这是 XRP 的一个特性。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep23/audio/lines/seg3-08.mp3",
   "start": 41.208,
   "dur": 4.272,
   "speechStart": 41.306,
   "speechEnd": 44.639
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-09",
   "text": "一笔支付写的请求金额，可以远大于实际到账的金额。",
   "spoken": "一笔支付写的请求金额，可以远大于实际到账的金额。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep23/audio/lines/seg3-09.mp3",
   "start": 45.7,
   "dur": 4.68,
   "speechStart": 45.798,
   "speechEnd": 49.548
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-10",
   "text": "2024 年 1 月，有人向 Bitfinex 发起了一笔部分支付。",
   "spoken": "2024 年 1 月，有人向 Bitfinex 发起了一笔部分支付。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep23/audio/lines/seg3-10.mp3",
   "start": 50.6,
   "dur": 5.04,
   "speechStart": 50.698,
   "speechEnd": 54.805
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-11",
   "text": "名义金额约 150 亿美元，实际到账约 0.001 美元。",
   "spoken": "名义金额约 150 亿美元，实际到账约 0.001 美元。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep23/audio/lines/seg3-11.mp3",
   "start": 55.86,
   "dur": 5.64,
   "speechStart": 55.958,
   "speechEnd": 60.648
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-12",
   "text": "Bitfinex 按实际到账金额入账，攻击没有成功。",
   "spoken": "Bitfinex 按实际到账金额入账，攻击没有成功。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep23/audio/lines/seg3-12.mp3",
   "start": 61.72,
   "dur": 4.632,
   "speechStart": 61.818,
   "speechEnd": 65.508
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-13",
   "text": "第四种，假代币，名字和符号都能照抄。",
   "spoken": "第四种，假代币，名字和符号都能照抄。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep23/audio/lines/seg3-13.mp3",
   "start": 66.572,
   "dur": 4.632,
   "speechStart": 66.67,
   "speechEnd": 70.36
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-14",
   "text": "第五种，伪造的转账事件，系统只看 Transfer 事件，不看它来自哪个合约。",
   "spoken": "第五种，伪造的转账事件，系统只看 Transfer 事件，不看它来自哪个合约。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep23/audio/lines/seg3-14.mp3",
   "start": 71.424,
   "dur": 6.48,
   "speechStart": 71.522,
   "speechEnd": 77.081
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-15",
   "text": "第六种，确认数不够就入账，之后区块回滚，这笔充值也跟着消失。",
   "spoken": "第六种，确认数不够就入账，之后区块回滚，这笔充值也跟着消失。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep23/audio/lines/seg3-15.mp3",
   "start": 78.124,
   "dur": 6.528,
   "speechStart": 78.222,
   "speechEnd": 83.805
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-16",
   "text": "这些形态，可以归成一条原则。",
   "spoken": "这些形态，可以归成一条原则。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep23/audio/lines/seg3-16.mp3",
   "start": 84.872,
   "dur": 3.288,
   "speechStart": 84.97,
   "speechEnd": 87.315
  },
  {
